OL,3,ARussian extremist group denies sending
OL,4,Ahoax bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "Male State", an extremist
OL,7,Fmisogynistic group named in this week's
OL,8,Fhoax bomb threats to Italian airports,
OL,9,Fhas denied any link to the false
OL,10,Fwarnings causing flight disruption
OL,11,Facross Europe.
OL,13,FThe comments to the BBC came as reports
OL,14,Fof more bomb scares to airlines began
OL,15,Fappearing, including on a Ryanair
OL,16,Fflight from Rome to Lisbon and a Wizz
OL,17,FAir flight from Prague to Rome which
OL,18,Fwas diverted to Venice.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
