OL,3,ARussian extremist group denies sending
OL,4,Ahoax bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FBomb threats were also reported to a
OL,7,Fnumber of high-profile Irish media
OL,8,Forganisations on Friday, prompting
OL,9,Fevacuations and a statement from the
OL,10,FIrish government suggesting a
OL,11,F"co-ordinated campaign of disruption".
OL,13,FReplying to the BBC Russian Service, an
OL,14,Faccount on Telegram - one of several
OL,15,Flinked to the so-called "Male State"
OL,16,Fand its founder Vladislav Pozdnyakov -
OL,17,Fmocked any suggestion the group was
OL,18,Finvolved in emailing the threats.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
